# reg.script -- GH1 regression walk on the gh1 card (C:\ACC\ window open, text view), 640x480, ticks 200 Hz after
# "[desk] desktop up". Each step starts from the top-left corner (four -128 moves).
#  1  +500  View -> Show as icons (menu click; NEWDESK handles MN_SELECTED inside its BEG/END_UPDATE bracket)
#  2  +1800 Desk -> Desktop info... (NEWDESK's own dialog, form_do nested in its bracket); +2800 Return closes it
#  3  +3700 click the closer of the C:\ACC\ window (Control Manager frame click -> WM_CLOSED -> parent C:\)
#  4  +4600 double-click the first icon of the C:\ window (~50,127)
#  5  +5600 Desk -> System Info (accessory open, AC_OPEN); +7000 Cancel (~468,455) closes it
#  6  +8000 View -> Show as text (menu works again after the accessory)
